Throwaway private key for the certificate beside it. Generated for this repository's tests, has
never protected anything, and matches a name reserved by RFC 2606 (.invalid) that cannot resolve.
The SEC1 "EC PRIVATE KEY" framing is the point: a loader that only knows PKCS#8 fails here, and
that is the exact failure this fixture exists to catch.

-----BEGIN EC PRIVATE KEY-----
